From f074d2b10a252e71c737e4425537837afa60640d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 08:16:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media-driver: Add missing
 gen12_tgllp/vp/kernel/{cmfc,cmfcpatch} include dirs

A real flashfiles build failed with a fatal file-not-found error:
vphal_renderer_g12_tgllp.cpp includes "igvpkrn_g12_tgllp_cmfc.h", whose
containing directory, gen12_tgllp/vp/kernel/cmfc, was excluded from
the earlier comprehensive include-dirs sweep alongside its
kernel/cmfcpatch sibling and both kernel_free equivalents as 'legacy
generation-specific kernel source duplicates'.

That exclusion was too broad: kernel/cmfc's and kernel/cmfcpatch's .c
sources (igvpkrn_g12_tgllp_cmfc.c, igvpkrn_g12_tgllp_cmfcpatch.c) are
actually compiled per Android.bp's srcs list, so their headers are
load-bearing. kernel_free/cmfc is a genuine, differently-contentted
duplicate (confirmed via diff) but is never referenced by any srcs
entry, so it remains correctly excluded -- no ambiguity results from
adding only the kernel/ variants.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 Android.bp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 2c8f867b9..db500ea0a 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -2461,7 +2461,9 @@ cc_library_shared {
         "media_driver/agnostic/gen12_tgllp",
         "media_driver/agnostic/gen12_tgllp/vp/hal",
         "media_driver/agnostic/gen12_tgllp/vp/kernel",
+        "media_driver/agnostic/gen12_tgllp/vp/kernel/cmfc",
         "media_driver/agnostic/gen12_tgllp/vp/kernel/cmfccmlpch",
+        "media_driver/agnostic/gen12_tgllp/vp/kernel/cmfcpatch",
         "media_driver/agnostic/gen12_tgllp/vp/kernel/swsb",
         "media_driver/agnostic/gen8/cm",
         "media_driver/agnostic/gen8/hw",
-- 
2.34.1

